+"""H200 Isaac collector for BC/DAgger RoboRender conditioning inputs.
+
+Collection records synchronized three-view depth, robot-only RGB, sparse
+episode anchors, student state, and expert/action labels.  It never publishes
+Isaac RGB as learner replay.  Rendering and learner admission are separate
+stages with separate immutable schemas.
+"""
