+        # The simulator contract stacks three 108x192 RGB views vertically and
+        # applies ImageNet normalization exactly once.  A sparse deterministic
+        # sample proves spatial content and view distinctness without retaining
+        # full images. Temporal liveness comes only from authorized raw-cache
+        # refresh evidence, never from held policy observations.
